<title>NETHERLANDS: Gilissen rates Getronics a Buy.</title>
<headline>Gilissen rates Getronics a Buy.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Aug 26 research.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>    Getronics	 Computers     40.80   Gilissen Bankiers</p>
<p>COMMENT: Buy (reiterated) - 1996 and 1997 earnings estimates raised after H1 results which were much better than consensus expectations. Strong organic growth and quick turnaround of Raet, which acquired jointly with Roccade. Getronics in good position to buy state-owned Roccade although new bidders driving up purchase price. Getronics shares trading at 22.7 times prospective 1997 earnings which not seen excessive for U.S. investors who hold around 50 percent of stock.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	pvs	P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1995 (actual)	1.14		  16.4*   0.25</p>
<p>    1996		   1.45     1.38     28.1    0.32</p>
<p>    1997		   1.80     1.65     22.7    0.40</p>
<p>* calculated with year-end share price</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
